  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Phase 5: Alumni Data Management Solution</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity relates to the procurement of a system to consolidate, manage, and&#xa0;and extract data about individual alumni of the Manaaki New&#xa0;Zealand Scholarships Programme.
The system will be used&#xa0;to store data about our alumni, segment them based on data we hold, extracts lists for use in email communications, and report on engagement between MFAT personnel and Alumni.
Personnel accessing the data and using the systems are located in Wellington and in our diplomatic Posts (outside New&#xa0;Zealand).</narrative>
  </description>
